      "text": "Korihor is trodden down by Zoramites2, Alma 30:59. if ye are not charitable, ye are as dross which is trodden under foot, Alma 34:29. salt that has lost savor is good for nothing but to be trodden under foot, 3 Ne. 12:13 (Matt. 5:13). Israel has been trodden under foot by Gentiles, 3 Ne. 16:8. the Lord will suffer Israel to go through Gentiles and tread them down, 3 Ne. 16:15 (20:16; 21:12). ye shall tread down wicked, 3 Ne. 25:3 (Mal. 4:3). Lamanites tread Nephites under feet, Morm. 5:6.",
